Zircon (rgr4y/zircon-darkplaces @ e19de67085f6c1602a43f4cf68ccc210a1033fad): fs_dircache.
Skip loose-file lookups under first-level folders that do not exist in a game directory.
Apply in a Zircon checkout at that commit: git apply darkplaces-fs-dircache.patch
Results and tests: docs/engine-fs-dircache-results.md

